      "author": "BenettonRugby",
      "avatar": null,
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OLhEEbwp6XU",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T16:00:12.000Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://i4.ytimg.com/vi/OLhEEbwp6XU/hqdefault.jpg",
      "source": "UCZWp6Nb9Rk6w6Dz_O_2nHqw"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx2krpozy52a",
      "text": "Todd Lawlor is the man in the Castore Player Spotlight this week 🔥\nThe Academy full-back has made 193 metres and beaten 8 defenders across his first two senior appearances in a Leinster shirt! 🤩",
      "author": "Leinster Rugby",
      "handle": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreidewh6iscgzmp56acshzhwoixyjoxxld6vj6bi76zvuyirnaqf66y",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/leinsterrugby.bsky.social/post/3mx2krpozy52a",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T14:00:15.857Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreieeozbleetsp2dwt6kk6om7pscdwl6t6gu6x5dqzdcsvwtsyplfym",
